, the level of challenge ramps up! You get to put your geography skills to the test, and really drill home what you want to learn. This includes the flags!The game now also features a permanent score. It's simple: each word i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T16:59:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682354","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:28:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4906690-1843481262697193","game_id":"steam-4906690","kind":"update","title":"Demo update: Equal Earth projection and more","summary":"Thank you for playing the Type the World demo!The demo has been updated with a few useful features:The country flag can now be displayed on the country label, placing it more directly in the field of view. This helps learning the flags.Country population and ISO country code can also be viewed on the label.The UN recently recommended the Equal Earth projection for general use, so it's been added to the game as an option. The original equirectangular projection is still the default.A few bug fixe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T09:46:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262697193","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:28:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4906690":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:14:36Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:14:36Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4906690":"2026-10-26T15:14:36Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4906690":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:14:36Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:14:36Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:14:36Z"},"4948880":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:14:36Z","last_success_a